  "description": "Since she ran away from the capital, Siomara has played it safe. Mainly she tries to ignore the Darkness that inhabits this world, which she is now capable of seeing, but more importantly, she makes sure that the Darkness ignores her as well. But when a mysterious neighbor moves in that could also be like her, Siomara must decide if she’ll risk getting closer to him, despite all the warnings of the danger that he comes with.\n\n(Source: Webtoon)",
